# WebClient (`ForensicsAnalyzer.WebClient`)

Blazor WASM talks to the API over HTTP + JWT. It must not reference Domain or Infrastructure.

- Use `Contracts` DTOs. Auth via `AuthService` / `AuthenticationStateProvider` / local storage — register in `Program.cs` when touching auth.
- Pages stay presentational; extract HTTP/auth logic into services (those services get unit tests).
- New routes, auth handlers, or client packages = architecture-gate question + docs (`PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md` Blazor section, `docs/features/`).

Verify UI changes in the browser when tools exist; otherwise say what could not be verified.
